nodes.body:
@benchislett @DarkLight1337 @fynnsu Hi guys, I just updated my approach to more simple way, since updates from `extract_hidden_states` and `CacheOnlyAttentionLayer` cannot solve this problem (the storing is happening in model side)

This is adding `CacheOnlyAttentionLayer` into models and storing the hidden states only when the kv params are set for mean pool connector. As tests show, it supports online serve, lora adapter, and the benchmark performance regression is marginal.

Currently, I updated llama and qwen3. If the approach is accepted, I will update all the other models.

